{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00946","headline":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 二 · 杜甫","name":"横吹曲辞 後出塞五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝进东门营，暮上河阳桥。\n落日照大旗，马鸣风萧萧。\n平沙列万幕，部伍各见招。\n中天悬明月，令严夜寂寥。\n悲笳数声动，壮士惨不骄。\n借问大将谁，恐是霍嫖姚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}